  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v1.1.0 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### New Features\n* feat(i18n): complete Spanish by @eddyflores100-lang in https://github.com/floatpane/matcha/pull/1733\n### Bug Fixes\n* fix: cache inline image payloads by @kawacukennedy in https://github.com/floatpane/matcha/pull/1707\n* fix: custom keybinds in help line by @andrinoff in https://github.com/floatpane/matcha/pull/1735\n* fix(jmap): helper to find inbox name by @andrinoff in https://github.com/floatpane/matcha/pull/1736\n### Documentation\n* docs: change the GIF to be for new matcha by @andrinoff in https://github.com/floatpane/matcha/pull/1725\n* docs: update demo.gif by @floatpanebot in https://github.com/floatpane/matcha/pull/1723\n### Dependencies\n* chore: bump charm deps by @andrinoff in https://github.com/floatpane/matcha/pull/1727\n* chore(deps): github.com/floatpane/bubble-overlay ^ v0.3.0 by @floatpanebot in https://github.com/floatpane/matcha/pull/1728\n### Chores\n* chore: remove the v1 candidate option by @andrinoff in https://github.com/floatpane/matcha/pull/1726\n* chore: sync gomod2nix.toml by @floatpanebot in https://github.com/floatpane/matcha/pull/1722\n* chore: update flake.lock by @floatpanebot in https://github.com/floatpane/matcha/pull/1721\n* chore: sync gomod2nix.toml by @floatpanebot in https://github.com/floatpane/matcha/pull/1729\n* chore: update flake.lock by @floatpanebot in https://github.com/floatpane/matcha/pull/1730\n\n## New Contributors\n* @eddyflores100-lang made their first contribution in https://github.com/floatpane/matcha/pull/1733\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/floatpane/matcha/compare/v1.0.1...v1.1.0\n\n---\nThis version is also available on **[Snapcraft](https://snapcraft.io/matcha)**, **Homebrew**, **[Flatpak](https://matcha.email/matcha.flatpakref)**!\n\nView the [installation instructions](https://docs.matcha.email/installation) for more details.\n\n",
